    <a class="back-link" href="/">← Back to home</a>
    <h1>Terms of Service & Legal Disclaimers</h1>
    <p class="note">Last updated: September 2026</p>

    <div class="install-help">
      <h2>1. Nature of the Service (Directory & Search Index)</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Web App Finder</strong> is an independent, community-driven discovery directory and search index for Progressive Web Apps (PWAs) and browser-based web applications.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Web App Finder is not an app store, broker, software distributor, or payment merchant.</strong> We do not develop, host, license, sell, distribute, or execute the underlying code of any third-party web applications listed in the catalog. All links provided direct users to external, third-party web domains operated independently by their respective publishers.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="install-help">
      <h2>2. Third-Party Websites & Applications Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        When you click a link or choose to open or install any third-party web application found on Web App Finder, you are leaving our site and accessing a service operated by an independent third party.
      </p>
      <p>
        We do not control, monitor, review, or endorse the content, policies, terms, code security, privacy practices, data handling, or reliability of any third-party websites or services. Any interactions, data sharing, transactions, payments, or software use are strictly and exclusively between you and the respective third-party provider.
      </p>
