        <strong>THE SERVICE AND ALL DIRECTORY LISTINGS ARE PROVIDED STRICTLY ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS, WITH ALL FAULTS AND WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
