      </p>
      <p>
        In no event shall Web App Finder or its maintainers be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages—including loss of data, loss of profits, loss of goodwill, device damage, financial loss, phishing incidents, or personal injury—arising out of or related to your use of this directory or any third-party web application listed herein.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="install-help">
      <h2>4. Meaning of Badges ("Verified" vs "At Your Own Risk")</h2>
      <p>
        The <span class="verified-badge">✔ Verified</span> badge indicates solely that an automated check and editorial review confirmed the listing points to the publisher's official, canonical domain (as opposed to an imitation or typo-squatted domain). <strong>It is not a security certificate, financial audit, code audit, or safety guarantee.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        Listings marked <span class="risk-badge">⚠ At your own risk</span> are contributed by the community and have only undergone basic automated reachability and manifest checks. You should exercise normal security caution when visiting any website. For full details on these checks, read <a href="/verification/">How verification works</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="install-help">
      <h2>5. Trademarks & Nominative Fair Use</h2>
      <p>
        All product names, logos, company names, trademarks, and registered trademarks referenced on Web App Finder are the property of their respective owners.
      </p>
      <p>
        Their use on this website is strictly for nominative, descriptive, and identification purposes (nominative fair use) to inform visitors about the genuine software and services available on the web. Reference to or display of any trademark, commercial product, or entity does not constitute or imply any affiliation with, sponsorship of, or endorsement by the trademark holder.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="install-help">
      <h2>6. Copyright, Screenshots & Delisting (Notice & Takedown)</h2>
      <p>
        Web App Finder respects intellectual property rights. App descriptions and screenshot images displayed on details pages are retrieved directly from the respective app's own publicly served Web App Manifest.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you are a copyright owner, trademark owner, or authorized publisher of an app listed here and wish to:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Request removal (delisting) of your app, name, or listing,</li>
        <li>Update inaccurate metadata or canonical URL, or</li>
        <li>Report intellectual property infringement,</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Please submit a <a href="https://github.com/kromans11-gmail/kromans11-gmail.github.io/issues/new?template=delist-app.yml" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Takedown or Delisting Request</a> on our GitHub repository or use the <strong>⚠ Report a problem</strong> button on any app details page. We process delisting and correction requests promptly.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="install-help">
      <h2>7. User-Generated Content & Community Guidelines</h2>
      <p>
        Community members may submit apps, votes, comments, and problem reports. By submitting any content to Web App Finder, you agree that your contribution:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Does not violate any law, intellectual property right, or privacy right.</li>
        <li>Does not contain malware, phishing links, deceptive claims, or malicious code.</li>
        <li>Does not contain adult, sexually explicit, defamatory, harassing, or hateful material.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We reserve the right, at our sole editorial discretion and without prior notice, to reject, remove, suspend, or modify any listing, submission, comment, or warning report that violates our standards or applicable regulations.
